#: setupgeneral.cpp:70
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"With this checkbox you indicate that you want to use idle detection. Unchecked, "
"RSIBreak will not reset the timers when you are idle for the duration of a "
"break, but will take into account the periods you are working or idle."
msgstr ""
"Con esta caixa pode indicar que quere que RSIBreak se arrinque xunto con KDE."

#: setupgeneral.cpp:77
msgid "&Show when timers are reset"
msgstr ""

#: setupgeneral.cpp:78
#, fuzzy
